</li><li> 10 different <strong>biomes </strong>to explore.<br></li><li> Face the <strong>Boss </strong>found in each biome, discover hidden bosses in an experience full of secrets<br></li><li> A travel experience in a parallel world will place the player at the centre of a narrative that <strong>breaks the fourth wall</strong>.</li></ul>",
